{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"Moreover Elihu answered|strong=\"H6030\",   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"“Do you|strong=\"H6664\"think|strong=\"H2803\"this|strong=\"H2063\"to|strong=\"H2803\"be your right|strong=\"H4941\",  \nor|strong=\"H4941\"do you|strong=\"H6664\"say, ‘My|strong=\"H2803\"righteousness|strong=\"H6664\"is|strong=\"H4941\"more than God’s,’   \n"},{"number":3,"text":"that|strong=\"H3588\"you|strong=\"H3588\"ask, ‘What|strong=\"H4100\"advantage|strong=\"H5532\"will|strong=\"H4100\"it|strong=\"H3588\"be|strong=\"H3588\"to|strong=\"H3588\"you|strong=\"H3588\"?  \nWhat|strong=\"H4100\"profit|strong=\"H3276\"will|strong=\"H4100\"I|strong=\"H3588\"have|strong=\"H2403\", more|strong=\"H3588\"than|strong=\"H3588\"if|strong=\"H3588\"I|strong=\"H3588\"had|strong=\"H3588\"sinned|strong=\"H2403\"?’   \n"},{"number":4,"text":"I will|strong=\"H7725\"answer|strong=\"H7725\"you|strong=\"H7725\",  \nand|strong=\"H7725\"your|strong=\"H7725\"companions|strong=\"H7453\"with|strong=\"H5973\"you|strong=\"H7725\".   \n"},{"number":5,"text":"Look|strong=\"H7200\"to|strong=\"H7200\"the|strong=\"H7200\"skies|strong=\"H7834\", and|strong=\"H8064\"see|strong=\"H7200\".  \nSee|strong=\"H7200\"the|strong=\"H7200\"skies|strong=\"H7834\", which are|strong=\"H8064\"higher|strong=\"H1361\"than|strong=\"H4480\"you|strong=\"H7200\".   \n"},{"number":6,"text":"If|strong=\"H2398\"you|strong=\"H6213\"have sinned|strong=\"H2398\", what|strong=\"H4100\"effect|strong=\"H6213\"do|strong=\"H6213\"you|strong=\"H6213\"have against|strong=\"H2398\"him|strong=\"H6213\"?  \nIf|strong=\"H2398\"your|strong=\"H6213\"transgressions|strong=\"H6588\"are|strong=\"H4100\"multiplied|strong=\"H7231\", what|strong=\"H4100\"do|strong=\"H6213\"you|strong=\"H6213\"do|strong=\"H6213\"to|strong=\"H6213\"him|strong=\"H6213\"?   \n"},{"number":7,"text":"If you|strong=\"H5414\"are|strong=\"H3027\"righteous|strong=\"H6663\", what|strong=\"H4100\"do|strong=\"H4100\"you|strong=\"H5414\"give|strong=\"H5414\"him|strong=\"H541